[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417845403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111511#issuecomment-3417845403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111511","id":3417845403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LuC6b","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T06:04:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T06:04:02Z","body":"This is great! \r\n\r\nFor context, we didn't add automatic instancing to the mobile renderer since it adds a lot of GPU overhead and Mobile devices tend to get GPU bound very quickly (they also get CPU bound quickly, but GPU is much worse). So, in general, we optimize the mobile renderer to reduce the cost on the GPU. Additionally, the extra indirection has a big performance penalty on older mobile devices that it doesn't have on Desktop devices. There is a real chance that merging this actually harms performance for people who use the renderer for its intended purpose, shipping games on mobile devices. \r\n\r\nWhat that means in simple terms is we need to carefully evaluate whether this change is worth making. \r\n\r\nWe identified that need when making the Mobile renderer, which is why we delayed adding this optimization. Before we merge this, we would need to test performance on a range of mobile devices with a range of scenes to ensure that there are no serious performance regressions. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417845403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417861703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111511#issuecomment-3417861703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111511","id":3417861703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LuG5H","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T06:13:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T06:13:50Z","body":"> Additionally, the extra indirection has a big performance penalty on older mobile devices that it doesn't have on Desktop devices.\r\n\r\nIn regards to this, from the looks of it the extra indirection has always been there. The mobile renderer has always been using instanced draws, just with 1 instance at a time. The shader code indexing into `instances.data` with `draw_call.instance_index` also suggests this fact. It's not like the Compatibility (OpenGL) renderer which specifically uses `glDrawArrays` and `glDrawElements` instead of `glDrawArraysInstanced` and `glDrawElementsInstanced`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3417861703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919231348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111511#issuecomment-3919231348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111511","id":3919231348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pmrl0","user":{"login":"moonjank","id":258881824,"node_id":"U_kgDOD245IA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258881824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank","html_url":"https://github.com/moonjank","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moonjank/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T07:46:26Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T07:46:26Z","body":"Is automatic instancing possible in compatibility?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3919231348/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]